(text "The DevKit plugs into two 22-pin sockets. Its own 3V3 pins are left open: the board makes +3V3 separately." (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3f28c466-25a1-492f-bf02-2a49ea0299a1))
(text "GPIO35-37 are used by the octal flash and PSRAM. GPIO47/48 are 1.8 V on the WROOM-2 and stay unused." (at 20.32 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 992c4b50-47ad-433f-8438-73bfcf7599d0))
